---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects">
  <h1>Projects</h1>
	<div class="project">
		<h3>Hide or Blur Images</h3>
		<p>A Chrome extension that allows users to hide or blur images on any webpage. 
			I built this to help people with Arachnophobia.</p>
		<p>
			<span> View source code on <a href="https://github.com/altanaldeniz/hide-or-blur-images">GitHub</a></span>
			<span>or install it from <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/hide-or-blur-images/blgggfgkhimhiomoibaaiplkdcffpefg">Chrome Web Store</a>.</span>
		</p>
		<p class="tech-stack">Tech Stack: HTML, CSS, JavaScript <span class="date">Last Updated: July 24, 2025</span></p>
	</div>
	<div class="project">
		<h3>Tic Tac Toe</h3>
		<p>A simple and minimal Tic Tac Toe game that I built 
			to teach myself about state management in React.</p>
		<p>
			<span> View source code on <a href="https://github.com/altanaldeniz/tic-tac-toe">GitHub</a></span>
			<span>or play it <a href="https://altanaldeniz.github.io/tic-tac-toe/">here</a>.</span>
		</p>
		<p class="tech-stack">Tech Stack: React, ContextAPI, TailwindCSS <span class="date">Last Updated: June 9, 2022</span></p>
	</div>
</Layout>
